<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-MONACO ALL BUT HOME AND DRY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MONACO ALL BUT HOME AND DRY.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monaco virtually ensured themselves the French first division championship when they beat Strasbourg 2-0 away on Tuesday to move 12 points clear in the standings.</p>
<p>Second-placed Paris St Germain must beat Lille on Wednesday to close the gap to nine points</p>
<p>They will snatch the title only if they win all their remaining matches while Monaco lose all theirs and overcome a goal deficit of 11.</p>
</text>
